<view class="container">
  <text class="page-title">联系我们</text>
  <text class="page-subtitle">iii. 反馈问题或建议</text>

  <view class="contact-list">
    <view class="contact-item card" wx:for="{{contacts}}" wx:key="label">
      <view class="contact-info">
        <text class="contact-label text-secondary">{{item.label}}</text>
        <text class="contact-value">{{item.value}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="copy-btn text-accent" wx:if="{{item.copyable}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="onCopy">
        <text>复制</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="note card">
    <text class="note-text text-secondary">如果遇到问题或有功能建议，欢迎通过以上方式联系我，会尽快回复。</text>
  </view>
</view>
